# civil-holidays v1
# jurisdiction: CL
# source: https://www.feriados.cl/  and Ley 19.973 (feriados nacionales) with
#   Ley 20.148 (San Pedro y San Pablo / Encuentro de Dos Mundos traslado),
#   Ley 20.299 (Iglesias Evangélicas), Ley 20.983 (2-Jan bridge) and Ley 19.668
#   / Ley 21.357 (Día Nacional de los Pueblos Indígenas, tied to the June
#   solstice). Local copy papers/holidays/cl_feriados_ley19973.html.
#   Cross-checked against vacanza/holidays 0.101 (MIT). Names are official Spanish.
#
#   Chile applies several distinct traslado rules and solstice/one-off feriados
#   that no single arithmetic kind captures cleanly, so the movable ones are
#   decree rows carrying the officially gazetted dates (an honest tabulation,
#   not a fabricated rule):
#     * San Pedro y San Pablo and Encuentro de Dos Mundos move to the nearest
#       Monday only in some weekday cases (Ley 20.148).
#     * Día de las Iglesias Evangélicas moves off 31 Oct in some years (Ley 20.299).
#     * Día Nacional de los Pueblos Indígenas falls on the June solstice
#       (Ley 21.357), 20 or 21 June.
#     * Feriado nacional (2 Jan) and the extra Fiestas Patrias bridge day are
#       one-off decrees granted only in qualifying years (2023, 2024).
#   The remaining holidays are fixed Gregorian dates or Easter offsets.
# retrieved: 2026-07-22
# categories: public|regional|municipal|religious|school (+ vacanza-parity labels, see below)
# columns: kind | name | args | categories | subdiv | observed | valid | span
#
# --- fixed / Easter ---
fixed  | Año Nuevo                          | 1 1   | public          |  |
easter | Viernes Santo                      | -2    | public religious |  |
easter | Sábado Santo                       | -1    | public religious |  |
fixed  | Día Nacional del Trabajo           | 5 1   | public          |  |
fixed  | Día de las Glorias Navales         | 5 21  | public          |  |
fixed  | Virgen del Carmen                  | 7 16  | public religious |  |
fixed  | Asunción de la Virgen              | 8 15  | public religious |  |
fixed  | Día de la Independencia            | 9 18  | public          |  |
fixed  | Día de las Glorias del Ejército    | 9 19  | public          |  |
fixed  | Día de Todos los Santos            | 11 1  | public religious |  |
fixed  | La Inmaculada Concepción           | 12 8  | public religious |  |
fixed  | Navidad                            | 12 25 | public religious |  |
#
# --- decree-tabulated movable / one-off feriados ---
decree | Feriado nacional                   | 2023-01-02 | public |  |
decree | Día Nacional de los Pueblos Indígenas | 2023-06-21 2024-06-20 2025-06-20 | public |  |
decree | San Pedro y San Pablo              | 2023-06-26 2024-06-29 2025-06-29 | public religious |  |
decree | Fiestas Patrias                    | 2024-09-20 | public |  |
decree | Día del Encuentro de dos Mundos    | 2023-10-09 2024-10-12 2025-10-12 | public |  |
decree | Día Nacional de las Iglesias Evangélicas y Protestantes | 2023-10-27 2024-10-31 2025-10-31 | public religious |  |

